00:20:56.520 --> 00:20:58.760
Second failure of the day…

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:01.290
<i>What an awful feeling!</i>

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:07.700
You did it, Hibunny!

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:10.770
No, I mean…

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:14.230
Rabbifoot! Rabbit Pokémon!
Fire type!

00:21:14.230 --> 00:21:21.180
Its thick and fluffy fur protects it from the cold
and enables it to use hotter Fire moves.

00:21:21.990 --> 00:21:24.160
You did it, Rabbifoot!

00:21:31.260 --> 00:21:35.930
Hibunny has conquered its trial alongside Go,
and evolved into Rabbifoot!

